{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"( <@!237577351532249110> pinging for easy access later:)\nKukudh flies in, holding a letter. they either hand it directly to Mender, or put it under a rock near their cottage (depending on his current location), before flying back to <#863743873411317800>.\nit reads, ||Mender,||\n||I apologise for leaving a message in this way - I feel the need to ask for your advice, but I need to rest, yet at the same time it would help if you knew the situation now.||\n||I'll keep it brief - when we left after Finn's revival, we encountered Bo and his 'friend', and a commotion. Some sort of... meat creature that 'he' had given life to, was on a berserk rampage, and 'he' requested help in subduing it, preferably alive. It... was  an abomination, and since it was hurting people - it attempted to eat one of us, for one, and many people were fleeing in fear. I thought it best to disregard the 'alive' request.||\n||As we were fighting it though, we noticed... it was sentient in some form, like a child, and in great pain from its... let's call it condition. We subdued it non-lethally, but I ended up persuading 'him' that it was better to put them out of their misery... A merciful death is better than a lifetime of suffering, right?||\n||...I see why people wanted me dead now. I don't know if my own pain was as clear as it was here, but... I understand. That creature... they reminded me of me, and I was ultimately responsible for their death. I feel like it was an act of mercy, but they didn't ask for this fate...||\n||If there's more important things to worry about, then I can wait to speak with you about it. Roy's helping me through it - he's always so [smudged] helpful - I should be alright by the time I wake up, just... If at all possible, I would like advice.||\n||I appreciate; ----Sabrine||","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:31:46.247000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868591311245168670","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
