{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"So more or less the entire picture. Yeah, even more reasons to be concerned about *his* practices. I'm at the very least disappointed by his actions. And probably also angry, I suppose. I want to trust Bo and Wintergreen about following him, and wanting to do good, but that's just ridiculous. Create something like that, let it go on a rampage, act concerned about it, but stay far behind when we deal with it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T11:12:26.450000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868812939119972393","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
