{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"A mound of meat in human shape, with animal parts attached to it. He first said that even if we don't manage to subdue it alive, he wanted to at least retrieve its heart, so it might be that that was running it. It seemed to only be hurt by spells and magical weapons, like my Mended Anew. It had a mouth on its stomach with tentacles that tried to pull Sonny inside.\"\n\n\"After a while it started talking like a child wanting to see its 'father'. We got it to weak enough that it could be put to sleep, and after that *he* arrived and stabbed it to take it out.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T11:18:45.851000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868814530443108412","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"He at least claimed it was not made from remains of dead people, but it doesn't really make it any better. Just the fact that it was given a mind like a child, and still went berserk, it wasn't treated like a child should. And if he didn't need human remains, that means Heore and him could make a new one.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T11:22:24.612000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868815447993245697","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she nods. '...it being a child... I know it was best for everyone, even it, but... it still felt wrong.'","created_at":"2021-07-25T11:23:16.352000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868815665006518272","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Sounds like an abomination... a monster.... that needed your mercy....\" he pauses to eat a good berry \"I would be more worried about that doctor in Hampstead making another one too....\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T11:25:18.240000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868816176241836042","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
